        <mxCell id="pYcYjqN06a3kEVqU8JDs-30" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;① 全局使能 DSP DMA 时钟/总线（dsp_dma_init）&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="2080" width="300" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pYcYjqN06a3kEVqU8JDs-31" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;② 上层装配 dma_cfg（方向、源/目的 device、地址模式、reload=1、32bit、burst、HT/TC 中断、cbk）&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="2120" width="560" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pYcYjqN06a3kEVqU8JDs-32" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;③ dsp_dma_channel_request 申请通道&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="2160" width="240" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pYcYjqN06a3kEVqU8JDs-33" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;④ dsp_dma_config 把字段落到 DSPDMAXCTL/SADDR/DADDR/XBC 寄存器并写 DSPDMAIP/IE 使能 HT/TC 中断、存 cbk&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="2200" width="560" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pYcYjqN06a3kEVqU8JDs-34" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;⑤ start 启动（RX 在 open、TX 在 sync_start）。RX 与 TX 唯一结构差异在源/目的 device 与地址模式互换，寄存器落地机制完全相同。&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="2250" width="560" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
